{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/pulls/915","id":4195859467,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSbOoU876F7wL","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/915","diff_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/915.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/915.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/915","number":915,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs: issue #914 vision planning pass — ninth-pass audit, case study, and epics E69-E77","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Solves #914.\n\n## What this is\n\nA documentation and planning pull request — no behavior code changes. It\ndelivers the three things issue #914 asks for, in order: documentation\nbrought in sync with the actual state of the code, the full set of\nGitHub issues needed to implement the vision (with critical\nvision-blocking code problems planned first), and the complete evidence\ncompiled into `docs/case-studies/issue-914/`.\n\n## Documentation sync (ninth-pass audit)\n\n`ROADMAP.md` gains a `2026-08-03 Requirement-Status Audit (issue #914)`\nsection that re-verifies every row of the 2026-07-14 table against the\nepic-status sweep and against `src/`. Four stale rows were corrected —\nexternal benchmarks (#698), multi-source search fusion (#709), candidate\nportfolios and budget search (#662/#704), and world-model dialogue\n(#702) all shipped after the eighth pass but were still listed as\nmissing. Agentic-CLI correctness was reopened as Partial because the\n#848 coding ladder (2 of 13 rungs at baseline, zero write effects)\nexposed the harness defect cluster #902-#909. `REQUIREMENTS.md` gains\nthe Issue #914 table (R914-1 to R914-15).\n\n## Opened issues: planning batch E69-E77\n\nNine epics created from the gap analysis, numbering continuing from E68.\nE69 is the foundation blocker; every capability epic declares its\ndependency on it.\n\n| Epic | Issue | Title |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| E69 | #916 | Coding-ladder ratchet over agent-harness fixes (foundation, blocker) |\n| E70 | #917 | General natural-formal translation through the meta language |\n| E71 | #918 | Minimal-core boundary and seed-metadata audit |\n| E72 | #919 | Research-driven coding knowledge loop |\n| E73 | #920 | Question-necessity protocol |\n| E74 | #921 | Hive-mind end-to-end integration gate |\n| E75 | #922 | Method learning for the universal problem-solving algorithm |\n| E76 | #923 | Formal-reasoning coverage growth |\n| E77 | #924 | Self-development loop, coding first |\n\n## Case study evidence\n\n`docs/case-studies/issue-914/` holds the README (current state and gap\nper vision theme, verified against the code), `requirements.md`\n(R914-1..R914-15), `solution-plan.md` (ten per-requirement plans, each\nnaming the existing components in this repository and outside it),\n`proposed-issues.md` (binding design rules plus the full epic bodies and\nopened-issue URLs), and `raw-data/` (GitHub snapshots, the 152-issue\nsweep since the eighth audit, and the external component/license\nresearch).\n\n## How to verify\n\n- `cargo test --test unit issue_914` runs the new docs-traceability\n  test `issue_914_case_study_and_planning_docs_are_traceable`\n  (`tests/unit/docs_requirements_issue_914.rs`), which asserts the\n  requirement tables, roadmap sections, case-study structure, and\n  recorded issue URLs all exist.\n- No behavior code changed, so the full existing suite is the\n  regression floor.\n- Changelog fragment `changelog.d/20260803_120000_issue_914_vision_planning.md`\n  (patch bump); the version itself is release-automation-managed.\n\n\n\nFixes #914","created_at":"2026-08-03T15:46:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-03T17:13:34Z","closed_at":"2026-08-03T17:13:33Z","merged_at":"2026-08-03T17:13:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"8f41970c7d1fa65ab842d5d3b2badf92c3b550dc","assignees":[{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/pulls/915/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/pulls/915/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com